 usually does his homeworks in the evening."},{"key":"D","text":"He usually does his homework in the evening."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"He does，homework 不可数，in the evening。","verify":"\"He usually does his homework in the evening.\""},{"id":"cne_j052_q1","topicId":"cne_j052","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Scott gets up at 6:00. He exercises at 6:30. He goes to school at 7:15. 他几点锻炼？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"6:00"},{"key":"B","text":"6:30"},{"key":"C","text":"7:15"},{"key":"D","text":"8:00"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"exercises at 6:30。","verify":"\"6:30\""},{"id":"cne_j052_q2","topicId":"cne_j052","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Scott gets up at 6:00. He exercises at 6:30. He goes to school at 7:15. 他几点上学？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"6:00"},{"key":"B","text":"6:30"},{"key":"C","text":"7:15"},{"key":"D","text":"7:45"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"goes to school at 7:15。","verify":"\"7:15\""},{"id":"cne_j052_q3","topicId":"cne_j052","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Mary usually does her homework at 7:00 in the evening. She never watches TV on school nights. 上学的晚上她看电视吗？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"总是看"},{"key":"B","text":"有时看"},{"key":"C","text":"只看半小时"},{"key":"D","text":"从不看"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"never watches TV on school nights。","verify":"\"从不看\""},{"id":"cne_j052_q4","topicId":"cne_j052","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Mary usually does her homework at 7:00 in the evening. 哪一句和短文一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Mary usually does homework at seven in the evening."},{"key":"B","text":"Mary never does homework."},{"key":"C","text":"Mary does homework at seven in the morning."},{"key":"D","text":"Mary gets up at 7:00."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"at 7:00 in the evening 是晚上七点。","verify":"\"Mary usually does homework at seven in the evening.\""}]
